  "details": "I saw today's build's features and i saw about the filters.\n\nI think it's a great idea but it should extend to instances as well.\n\nWhat i mean by that is be able to open an instance and put our own Filters on it.\n\nYes some map may be suited for everyone, but the peoples joining might not be ! And so a warning could be useful, imagine the theme of the night being drinking or spooky video/theme, it might not be appropriate to some peoples.\n\nI don't know if i explained myself well but im sure many get what i mean and feel free to share your opinion !",
